1
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:07,760
Slide 30 declares "THE DIGITAL MANDATE: Soli Deo Gloria in Systems Engineering."

2
00:00:08,460 --> 00:00:12,104
Look at the three foundational commitments on the screen.

3
00:00:12,104 --> 00:00:20,480
Point 1 is Absolute Data Integrity: We commit to building agents that never generate deceptive, hallucinated, or unverified claims.

4
00:00:21,180 --> 00:00:32,510
Point 2 is Uncompromising Privacy: We rigorously protect user credentials, confidential enterprise data, and personal privacy across all agent pipelines.

5
00:00:33,210 --> 00:00:43,460
And Point 3 is Humble Stewardship: We use our technological knowledge not for selfish vanity or destructive disruption, but to uplift human communities and glorify God.

6
00:00:44,160 --> 00:00:49,600
Engineering excellence is fundamentally a moral and ethical commitment.

7
00:00:49,600 --> 00:00:51,670
That is the Oikos standard.

